# The language page on the voices named as INSTALL.EXE writes them
# (fixtures/langpagecp437: sound's lba.cfg, LanguageCD: Français in
# CP437). The page opens on Voices: Français, where the Classic, matching
# its own names alone, opens it on None.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Down Return
sleep 3
key Down Down Down Down Return
sleep 3
shot page
key Return
sleep 3
shot options
